# Benchmark results: the CSVs and environment.json ARE tracked on purpose --
# they are the provenance of every performance figure reported in the paper.
# Excluded here:
#   - *.log: byproduct of run_all_cohorts.py, carries local absolute paths,
#     and the same data is already in cohort_ingestion.csv
#   - SUMMARY.md: internal working notes, not a release artefact
results/benchmark/*.log
results/benchmark/SUMMARY.md


